eviewButton", "name": "", "text": "Blur", "tip": "Blur\nBox / Gaussian / Bilateral / Motion / Bokeh blur with per-channel mask and mix.", "visible": true, "enabled": true}, {"class": "_EffectPreviewButton", "name": "", "text": "Sharpen", "tip": "Sharpen\nUnsharp-mask sharpening with threshold and channel mode.", "visible": true, "enabled": true}, {"class": "_EffectPreviewButton", "name": "", "text": "Denoise", "tip": "Denoise\nBilateral-filter denoise with luma/chroma mode.", "visible": true, "enabled": true}, {"class": "_EffectPreviewButton", "name": "", "text": "Edge Detect", "tip": "Edge Detect\nEdge detection (Sobel/Laplacian/Prewitt/Canny).", "visible": true, "enabled": true}, {"class": "_EffectPreviewButton", "name": "", "text": "Erode / Dilate", "tip": "Erode / Dilate\nMorphological erode/dilate with iteration control.", "visible": true, "enabled": true}, {"class": "_EffectPreviewButton", "name": "", "text": "Defocus", "tip": "Defocus\nLens defocus / bokeh blur.", "visible": true, "enabled": true}, {"class": "_EffectPreviewButton", "name": "", "text": "Glow", "tip": "Glow\nBloom/glow with threshold, tint and intensity.", "visible": true, "enabled": true}, {"class": "_EffectPreviewButton", "name": "", "text": "Adjustment Clip", "tip": "Adjustment Clip\nCreate a clip that applies its effects to all tracks below it", "visible": true, "enabled": true}, {"class": "_EffectPreviewButton", "name": "", "text": "Solid Color", "tip": "Solid Color\nCreate a clip that paints a flat color frame", "visible": true, "enabled": true}, {"class": "_EffectPreviewButton", "name": "", "text": "假红外", "tip": "假红外\nFalse-color infrared look: luminous red foliage, sunken skies, dreamy inverse-luma glow", "visible": true, "enabled": true}, {"class": "_EffectPreviewButton", "name": "", "text": "双边皮肤平滑", "tip": "双边皮肤平滑\n", "visible": true, "enabled": true}, {"class": "_EffectPreviewButton", "name": "", "text": "白平衡进阶", "tip": "白平衡进阶\nTemperature/tint white balance in scene-linear with channel-gain or exact luma-preserving correction modes", "visible": true, "enabled": true}, {"class": "_EffectPreviewButton", "name": "", "text": "哑光肤色平滑", "tip": "哑光肤色平滑\nSkin-tone selective matte smoothing via YCbCr skin detection and skin-gated frequency separation with texture keep-back", "visible": true, "enabled": true}, {"class": "_EffectPreviewButton", "name": "", "text": "角落漏光", "tip": "角落漏光\nCorner-originated light leak: aspect-corrected soft falloff from a selectable frame corner, additive in scene-linear", "visible": true, "enabled": true}, {"class": "_EffectPreviewButton", "name": "", "text": "光圈散焦", "tip": "光圈散焦\nDefocus blur with selectable iris: staggered-ring circular disc or aligned-ring hexagonal aperture, compile-time shell presets", "visible": true, "enabled": true}, {"class": "_EffectPreviewButton", "name": "", "text": "边缘描墨", "tip": "边缘描墨\nSobel outline inking: 8-neighbor gradient magnitude on selectable luma source, soft-thresholded into a tintable ink overlay", "visible": true, "enabled": true}, {"class": "_EffectPreviewButton", "name": "", "text": "漂白旁路", "tip": "漂白旁路\nBleach bypass look: high-contrast, low-saturation silver film response", "visible": true, "enabled": true}, {"class": "_EffectPreviewButton", "name": "", "text": "饱和度 / 活泼度", "tip": "饱和度 / 活泼度\nSplit saturation and vibrance control: chroma gain plus low-saturation-weighted vibrance boost with exact 709 luma preservation", "visible": true, "enabled": true}, {"class": "_EffectPreviewButton", "name": "", "text": "通道混合", "tip": "通道混合\nPer-channel RGB mixing matrix: three output gains plus six signed crosstalk sliders, applied linearly with strength blend", "visible": true, "enabled": true}, {"class": "_EffectPreviewButton", "name": "", "text": "线性运动模糊", "tip": "线性运动模糊\nDirectional linear motion blur: centered tap line along a user angle with compile-time sample-count presets", "visible": true, "enabled": true}, {"class": "_EffectPreviewButton", "name": "", "text": "三路色调", "tip": "三路色调\nSeparate tint grading for shadows, midtones and highlights with smooth luminance zone blending and HDR-safe multiplicative color gains", "visible": true, "enabled": true}, {"class": "_EffectPreviewButton", "name": "", "text": "信号毛刺", "tip": "信号毛刺\nDigital signal glitch: hash-activated horizontal band displacement with RGB channel split, deterministic per band", "visible": true, "enabled": true}, {"class": "_EffectPreviewButton", "name": "", "text": "变形镜头拉丝", "tip": "变形镜头拉丝\nHorizontal anamorphic lens streak: highlight-gated taps along +/-X with distance falloff, quality presets and tintable streak color", "visible": true, "enabled": true}, {"class": "_EffectPreviewButton", "name": "", "text": "万花筒镜像", "tip": "万花筒镜像\nFold-mirror kaleidoscope: horizontal / vertical / quad folding about an adjustable axis plus diagonal reflection, mix-controlled", "visible": true, "enabled": true}, {"class": "_EffectPreviewButton", "name": "", "text": "径向模糊 Pro", "tip": "径向模糊 Pro\nZoom/radial blur along center-to-pixel rays with compile-time sample-count presets and adjustable center", "visible": true, "enabled": true}, {"class": "_EffectPreviewButton", "name": "", "text": "色彩空间转换器", "tip": "色彩空间转换器\nProfessional color space and gamma converter with tone mapping and white point adaptation", "visible": true, "enabled": true}, {"class": "_EffectPreviewButton", "name": "", "text": "像素块", "tip": "像素块\nMosaic pixelation with per-block center sampling, linear color quantization and optional 4x4 ordered dither", "visible": true, "enabled": true}, {"class": "_EffectPreviewButton", "name": "", "text": "日转夜转换", "tip": "日转夜转换\nHeuristic day-for-night look: luminance-weighted exposure pull-down, cool temperature shift, sky highlight protection and a slight moonlight blue lift; HDR-safe with no output clamping", "visible": true, "enabled": true}, {"class": "_EffectPreviewButton", "name": "", "text": "扩展光晕", "tip": "扩展光晕\nHighlight diffusion glow with hue-adjustable tint (halation variant, alternating-direction ring kernel)", "visible": true, "enabled": true}, {"class": "_EffectPreviewButton", "name": "", "text": "交叉冲洗", "tip": "交叉冲洗\nCross-process film look family: crossed rational channel curves with dye-fog crosstalk between channels", "visible": true, "enabled": true}, {"class": "_EffectPreviewButton", "name": "", "text": "反锐化锐化", "tip": "反锐化锐化\nUnsharp mask sharpening: compile-time 3x3/5x5 inverse-distance kernel, radius to 8 px and edge-gated detail amplification", "visible": true, "enabled": true}, {"class": "_EffectPreviewButton", "name": "", "text": "Warm Tint", "tip": "Warm Tint\nAdds a gentle warm tint; declares OpenGL export support (W06 deliverable-plugin slice).", "visible": true, "enabled": true}, {"class": "_EffectPreviewButton", "name": "", "text": "网点印刷", "tip": "网点印刷\nHalftone print screening: rotated constant-matrix dot lattice, luminance-sized dots with soft anti-aliased coverage", "visible": true, "enabled": true}, {"class": "_EffectPreviewButton", "name": "", "text": "镜头畸变", "tip": "镜头畸变\nRadial lens distortion (barrel/pincushion) with r2 polynomial remap, manual zoom compensation and auto-zoom framing guard", "visible": true, "enabled": true}, {"class": "_EffectPreviewButton", "name": "", "text": "柔光泛光", "tip": "柔光泛光\nThreshold-based soft glow and bloom with multi-pass ring blur approximation", "visible": true, "enabled": true}, {"class": "_EffectPreviewButton", "name": "", "text": "渐变曝光滤镜", "tip": "渐变曝光滤镜\nRotatable graduated ND exposure filter: smoothstep feathered linear ramp of exposure stops along a user angle", "visible": true, "enabled": true}, {"class": "_EffectPreviewButton", "name": "", "text": "多形状暗角", "tip": "多形状暗角\nMulti-shape vignette (ellipse / rectangle / circle) with smoothstep feather, strength blend and mean-preserving luma compensation", "visible": true, "enabled": true}, {"class": "_EffectPreviewButton", "name": "", "text": "CRT 扫描线", "tip": "CRT 扫描线\nCRT display emulation: triangle-wave scanlines and offset-triangle aperture grille mask, brightness-neutral multiplicative gains", "visible": true, "enabled": true}, {"class": "_EffectPreviewButton", "name": "", "text": "移轴焦点", "tip": "移轴焦点\nTilt-shift miniature look: orientation-selectable focus band with smoothstep falloff driving a fixed 17-tap disc blur radius", "visible": true, "enabled": true}, {"class": "_EffectPreviewButton", "name": "", "text": "高通磨皮", "tip": "高通磨皮\nFrequency-domain skin retouching using high-pass filtering (band-stop filter)", "visible": true, "enabled": true}, {"class": "_EffectPreviewButton", "name": "", "text": "棱镜色散", "tip": "棱镜色散\nRotatable radial RGB dispersion: channel-split sampling grows with center distance and adjustable edge falloff", "visible": true, "enabled": true}, {"class": "_EffectPreviewButton", "name": "", "text": "双色调", "tip": "双色调\nDuotone/tritone luminance ramp: linear shadow-to-highlight color map with detail keep-back and selectable luma source", "visible": true, "enabled": true}, {"class": "_EffectPreviewButton", "name": "", "text": "胶片光晕", "tip": "胶片光晕\n", "visible": true, "enabled": true}, {"class": "_EffectPreviewButton", "name": "", "text": "胶片颗粒", "tip": "胶片颗粒\nFilm-style monochrome grain: smooth hash value-noise lattice modulated by luminance, with shadow/highlight bias", "visible": true, "enabled": true}, {"class": "_MotionGraphicPreviewButton", "name": "", "text": "Particle Flow Background", "tip": "Particle Flow Background\nCyan particle streams with soft glows over a dark grid, usable as an animated backdrop for video content.", "visible": true, "enabled": true}, {"class": "QToolButton", "name": "ScrollLeftButton", "text": "", "tip": "", "visible": false, "enabled": false}, {"class": "QToolButton", "name": "ScrollRightButton", "text": "", "tip": "", "visible": false, "enabled": false}, {"class": "QToolButton", "name": "", "text": "", "tip": "Search effects", "visible": true, "enabled": true}, {"class": "QAbstractButton", "name": "qt_dockwidget_floatbutton", "text"